### Create a new realm (token from auth.http, realm master)
# Denied in the core (@DenyAll): RealmAdminResource moves to orgkeep-saas.
POST http://localhost:8282/admin/realms
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "realmName": "demo",
  "adminEmail": "admin@test.com",
  "adminPassword": "password"
}
